     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Friday, January 26, 2018 at 12:46:06 PM UTC+1, Jose Jimenez wrote:</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div lang=\"ES\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Hi Ugoline:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Try it:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">devtools::session_info()</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">library(devtools)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">install_github(&quot;nimble-dev/nimble&quot;, ref = &quot;devel&quot;, subdir = &quot;packages/nimble&quot;, force=TRUE)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">library(nimble)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Best regards,</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">José</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">De:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> <a rel=\"nofollow\">nimble...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a rel=\"nofollow\">nimble...@googlegroups.com</a>]\r\n<b>En nombre de </b>ugoline godeau<br>\r\n<b>Enviado el:</b> viernes, 26 de enero de 2018 12:29<br>\r\n<b>Para:</b> nimble-users &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">nimble...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Asunto:</b> Re: Problem with monitoring logProbs in some nimble versions</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hello,</p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thank you for the fix, but I don&#39;t seem to understand how to install the package from the devel branch.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Could you explain it to me please</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thank you in advance</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Ugoline<br>\r\n<br>\r\nLe dimanche 17 décembre 2017 18:06:13 UTC+1, <a rel=\"nofollow\">\r\nnmic...@berkeley.edu</a> a écrit :</p>\r\n<blockquote style=\"border:none;border-left:solid #cccccc 1.0pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 6.0pt;margin-left:4.8pt;margin-right:0cm\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi Frédéric,</p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Sorry for the long delay!  A fix for this bug is now available in the `devel` branch of NIMBLE&#39;s github repo (<a href=\"https://github.com/nimble-dev/nimble\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/nimble-dev/nimble&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478905141000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1MkSAZxJ8NIk9ZpZNt7i-4\">link here</a>).  If you install NIMBLE from the devel branch, you\r\n should again be able to monitor logProb variables when running MCMC algorithms.  Please let me know if the problem continues though, thanks!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Nick  <br>\r\n<br>\r\nOn Thursday, November 30, 2017 at 8:33:38 AM UTC-8, Frédéric Gosselin wrote:</p>\r\n<blockquote style=\"border:none;border-left:solid #cccccc 1.0pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 6.0pt;margin-left:4.8pt;margin-right:0cm\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thank you David. sessionInfo() is great! So the Nimble version I am using is 0.6-7.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nFrédéric</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
